{"seq":6,"slug":"game-design","title":"游戏设计与关卡设计","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/game-development/game-design","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 游戏设计与关卡设计 简介\n\n游戏设计是将创意转化为可玩体验的系统性方法论，而关卡设计则是将游戏机制落地为具体空间和挑战的实践技艺。优秀的游戏设计能让玩家沉浸其中、欲罢不能，而糟糕的设计即使有顶尖的技术和美术也难以挽回。\n\n本知识库适用于有一定游戏开发经验、希望系统学习游戏设计理论和关卡设计方法的开发者与设计师。无论你是独立开发者还是大团队中的设计师，这里的内容都将帮助你建立从理论到实践的完整设计思维。\n\n第1章**游戏设计基础**讲解游戏设计的核心理论，包括核心机制的提炼、玩家体验分析、游戏平衡性设计以及反馈系统的构建，为理解所有设计决策提供理论基础。\n\n第2章**关卡设计**深入探讨将游戏机制空间化的方法，涵盖关卡设计原则、空间构成技巧、难度曲线设计以及快速原型验证流程，帮助你设计出引导自然、节奏得当的游戏关卡。\n\n第3章**游戏经济系统**聚焦于游戏中的资源与经济设计，包括虚拟经济模型、资源流转设计、商业化策略以及经济平衡调优，这些是让游戏长期运营并保持活力的关键。\n\n第4章**叙事设计**探索游戏独有的互动叙事方法，涵盖互动叙事结构、对话系统设计、世界观构建以及环境叙事技巧，展示如何用游戏这一独特媒介讲述引人入胜的故事。\n\n推荐学习路径：建议从第1章游戏设计基础开始建立设计思维框架，然后学习第2章关卡设计掌握空间设计的实用技能，再根据项目类型选择第3章经济系统或第4章叙事设计深入学习。各章内容相对独立，可根据你当前面临的设计挑战灵活选择。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-design-fundamentals","title":"游戏设计基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"core-mechanics","title":"核心机制设计","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/core-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"player-experience","title":"玩家体验与心流","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/player-experience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-balance","title":"游戏平衡性设计","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/game-balance"},{"seq":4,"slug":"feedback-systems","title":"反馈系统与奖励机制","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/feedback-systems"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"level-design","title":"关卡设计","docCount":4,"url":"/h/game-development/game-design/level-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"level-design-principles","title":"关卡设计原则","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/level-design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spatial-composition","title":"空间构成与引导","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/spatial-composition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"difficulty-curve","title":"难度曲线设计","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/difficulty-curve"},{"seq":4,"slug":"level-prototyping","title":"关卡原型与迭代","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/level-design/level-prototyping"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-economy","title":"游戏经济系统","docCount":4,"url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-economy","title":"虚拟经济体系","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/virtual-economy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-flow","title":"资源流动与循环","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/resource-flow"},{"seq":3,"slug":"monetization","title":"商业化模式设计","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/monetization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"economy-balancing","title":"经济系统调优","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/economy-balancing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"narrative-design","title":"叙事设计","docCount":4,"url":"/h/game-development/game-design/narrative-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interactive-storytelling","title":"交互式叙事","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/narrative-design/interactive-storytelling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dialogue-systems","title":"对话系统设计","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/narrative-design/dialogue-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"world-building","title":"世界观构建","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/narrative-design/world-building"},{"seq":4,"slug":"environmental-storytelling","title":"环境叙事","url":"/h/game-development/game-design/narrative-design/environmental-storytelling"}]}]}